STAAD PLANE BEAM 230 X 300 FOUR POINT BENDING CHECK
* Batch 120ABR: independent check of the IS 456 hand calculations
* Units: metre, kilonewton. Simply supported span 3.0 m, nodes every 0.25 m.
* Loads at third points (nodes 5 and 9), 35 kN each = total jack load 70 kN.
START JOB INFORMATION
ENGINEER DATE 13-Oct-26
END JOB INFORMATION
INPUT WIDTH 79
UNIT METER KN
JOINT COORDINATES
1 0 0 0; 2 0.25 0 0; 3 0.5 0 0; 4 0.75 0 0; 5 1.0 0 0; 6 1.25 0 0; 7 1.5 0 0;
8 1.75 0 0; 9 2.0 0 0; 10 2.25 0 0; 11 2.5 0 0; 12 2.75 0 0; 13 3.0 0 0;
MEMBER INCIDENCES
1 1 2; 2 2 3; 3 3 4; 4 4 5; 5 5 6; 6 6 7; 7 7 8; 8 8 9; 9 9 10; 10 10 11;
11 11 12; 12 12 13;
DEFINE MATERIAL START
ISOTROPIC M30CONCRETE
* E = 5000 x sqrt(30) MPa = 27,386 MPa (IS 456 cl 6.2.3.1)
E 2.7386e+07
POISSON 0.2
DENSITY 25
ALPHA 1e-05
DAMP 0.05
END DEFINE MATERIAL
MEMBER PROPERTY INDIAN
1 TO 12 PRIS YD 0.3 ZD 0.23
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL M30CONCRETE ALL
SUPPORTS
1 PINNED
13 FIXED BUT FX MZ
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE Dead TITLE SELF WEIGHT
SELFWEIGHT Y -1
LOAD 2 LOADTYPE Live TITLE JACK LOAD 70 KN TOTAL
JOINT LOAD
5 9 FY -35
LOAD 3 LOADTYPE None TITLE SERVICE CHECK 15 KN TOTAL
JOINT LOAD
5 9 FY -7.5
LOAD 5 LOADTYPE None TITLE MODAL
SELFWEIGHT X 1
SELFWEIGHT Y 1
MODAL CALCULATION REQUESTED
LOAD COMB 4 DESIGN 1.5 DEAD PLUS JACK LOAD
1 1.5 2 1.0
PERFORM ANALYSIS PRINT STATICS CHECK
PRINT JOINT DISPLACEMENTS LIST 7
PRINT MEMBER FORCES LIST 1 6 7
PRINT SUPPORT REACTION
LOAD LIST 4
START CONCRETE DESIGN
CODE INDIAN
UNIT MMS NEWTON
FC 30 ALL
FYMAIN 500 ALL
FYSEC 415 ALL
CLEAR 25 ALL
MAXMAIN 12 ALL
MINMAIN 10 ALL
MINSEC 8 ALL
DESIGN BEAM 1 TO 12
END CONCRETE DESIGN
FINISH
